patterns, tokenizer exceptions, sentencizer punctuation), extracted from spaCy
by generate_tables.py. spaCy's URL pattern credits https://mathiasbynens.be/demo/url-regex
and https://gist.github.com/dperini/729294 (Diego Perini, MIT License).

